OL,3,GNEWSADisappointment over stalled free
OL,4,Aparking plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move would have largely reversed
OL,7,Fchanges made by the previous Labour
OL,8,Fadministration as part of cost-cutting
OL,9,Fmeasures introduced amid pressure on
OL,10,Fthe council's finances.
OL,12,FBut following a council meeting on
OL,13,FTuesday, the authority confirmed the
OL,14,Fplans were "not deliverable" in the
OL,15,Fshort term.
